  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">這是一個修復小物體（雪、按鈕、草…）阻礙鐵魔像生成的模組</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_857b15b2-9c34-435c-b9cd-eeee262ae774.gif\" alt=\"模組影片示範\" width=\"476\" height=\"268\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">適用於：</span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">按鈕</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">蠟燭</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">地毯</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">雪</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">小型植物</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">花朵</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">花盆</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">相容於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-spawn-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵魔像生成動畫</a>！&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">靈感來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wither-spawn-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">凋零怪生成修復</a></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#3af387\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3af387\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgolem-spawn-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/eFjWWvNphY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ITIIVc1.jpeg\" alt=\"Discord 邀請\" width=\"358\" height=\"98\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/boboMCmods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1EGs51Y.png\" alt=\"支持我的 Patreon 連結\" width=\"360\" height=\"96\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbo_bo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow